    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61967" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάρῐνος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱ], ὁ</span>, a kind of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sea-fish</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				3.399
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάριμος</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾱρῐναῖον</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύρτον: οἱ ἁλιεῖς τὸν ἐκ
				λε&lt;υ&gt;κέας, ἢ μέγαν</span>,
				Id.:—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾱρῐνευτής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>, ὁ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλιεύς</span>
			, Id.</div>
